WEBVTT

NOTE Elephant Stomp & Sway: Bop at Home movement break. Activity footage starts at 4.000 s.

title
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:03.900
[Title] Futures Friends. Movement break: Elephant Stomp & Sway. Move along with Bop.

1
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:07.140
<v Bop>Hi, friends! I'm Bop.

2
00:00:07.180 --> 00:00:12.740
<v Bop>Stomp with me! Right, left!

3
00:00:12.780 --> 00:00:18.240
<v Bop>Now sway, sway, like a gentle tree.

4
00:00:18.280 --> 00:00:22.750
<v Bop>One, two! Your turn!

5
00:00:25.580 --> 00:00:30.640
<v Bop>Stomp and sway! Great job!

6
00:00:30.680 --> 00:00:33.840
<v Bop>Freeze... you did it!

7
00:00:33.880 --> 00:00:36.240
<v Bop>Ready? Bop and go!

8
00:00:36.280 --> 00:00:39.150
<v Bop>Let's do it again!

9
00:00:40.480 --> 00:00:44.240
<v Bop>Stomp your heavy elephant feet...

10
00:00:44.280 --> 00:00:46.840
<v Bop>One, two, three!

11
00:00:46.880 --> 00:00:51.340
<v Bop>Now swing your trunk from side to side...

12
00:00:51.380 --> 00:00:55.040
<v Bop>Swish... swish!

13
00:00:55.080 --> 00:00:58.340
<v Bop>Slow... down...

14
00:00:58.380 --> 00:01:00.940
<v Bop>Now you're a sleepy elephant.

15
00:01:00.980 --> 00:01:03.640
<v Bop>Shhh... sleepy elephant.

16
00:01:03.680 --> 00:01:07.540
<v Bop>Good morning, elephant! Time to wake up!

17
00:01:07.580 --> 00:01:10.440
<v Bop>Let's be elephants sitting down.

18
00:01:10.480 --> 00:01:12.940
<v Bop>Everybody can do it!

19
00:01:12.980 --> 00:01:16.140
<v Bop>Pat your knees like elephant feet...

20
00:01:16.180 --> 00:01:19.540
<v Bop>One, two, three!

21
00:01:19.580 --> 00:01:23.740
<v Bop>Now make a big trunk with both arms.

22
00:01:23.780 --> 00:01:29.140
<v Bop>Swing... and swing... and swing!

23
00:01:29.180 --> 00:01:30.440
<v Bop>Ta-da!

24
00:01:30.480 --> 00:01:34.540
<v Bop>Sitting or standing, you did it!

25
00:01:34.580 --> 00:01:38.440
<v Bop>Now let's do it very, very quietly.

26
00:01:38.480 --> 00:01:40.340
<v Bop>Shhh.

27
00:01:40.380 --> 00:01:42.740
<v Bop>Quiet knee pats...

28
00:01:42.780 --> 00:01:47.150
<v Bop>One, two, three.

29
00:01:47.880 --> 00:01:50.940
<v Bop>Now a slow, quiet trunk.

30
00:01:50.980 --> 00:01:56.640
<v Bop>Hum with me. [Bop hums softly]

31
00:01:56.680 --> 00:02:00.350
<v Bop>Now let's stand up tall!

endcard
00:02:04.150 --> 00:02:08.150
[End card] Great moving, friends! Learn. Move. Explore. Belong.
A Futures Friends movement break.
